WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.485 --> 00:00:02.825
- Now I know that you've
heard me say many times

00:00:02.825 --> 00:00:05.036
or you've read or listened on the tapes

00:00:05.036 --> 00:00:09.193
that loving yourself is the
most powerful thing we can do.

00:00:09.193 --> 00:00:12.627
I think that everything you
think and everything you speak

00:00:12.627 --> 00:00:14.693
goes out from you into the universe

00:00:14.693 --> 00:00:17.468
and comes back to you multiplied.

00:00:17.468 --> 00:00:21.239
What good is a nice car if
you are full of resentment

00:00:21.239 --> 00:00:22.270
all the time.

00:00:22.270 --> 00:00:24.409
There is a law of thinking

00:00:24.409 --> 00:00:26.429
and we are beginning to learn about it

00:00:26.429 --> 00:00:28.575
and it is like a computer.

00:00:28.575 --> 00:00:31.257
Everything we give out can help people

00:00:31.257 --> 00:00:33.903
really improve the quality of their lives.

00:00:33.903 --> 00:00:34.896
When there's problems,

00:00:34.896 --> 00:00:36.924
we don't have to fix problems so much,

00:00:36.924 --> 00:00:38.741
we need to fix our thinking.

00:00:38.741 --> 00:00:40.723
Because there's something very powerful

00:00:40.723 --> 00:00:44.890
about looking in your own
eyes and accepting yourself.

00:00:46.647 --> 00:00:49.460
When I get to a really
good level then it's like,

00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:52.100
okay now we're going to
deal with this thing.

00:00:52.100 --> 00:00:54.868
I say thank you many many
many times of the day,

00:00:54.868 --> 00:00:56.312
often not to anyone else,

00:00:56.312 --> 00:00:59.155
just oh thank you that's so wonderful.

00:00:59.155 --> 00:01:01.838
One of my thoughts about life

00:01:01.838 --> 00:01:04.902
is that only good lies before me.

00:01:04.902 --> 00:01:07.006
- She's an american motivational author,

00:01:07.006 --> 00:01:09.434
she's the founder of
Hay House A New Thought

00:01:09.434 --> 00:01:10.833
and self-help publisher.

00:01:10.833 --> 00:01:13.392
She has authored several
New Thought self-help books,

00:01:13.392 --> 00:01:17.324
including her 1984 classic
You Can Heal Your Life.

00:01:17.324 --> 00:01:19.467
She's Louise Hay and here's my take

00:01:19.467 --> 00:01:22.134
on her top 10 rules for success.

00:01:24.794 --> 00:01:26.900
- Now I know that you've
heard me say many times

00:01:26.900 --> 00:01:29.341
or you've read or listened on the tapes

00:01:29.341 --> 00:01:34.293
that loving yourself is the
most powerful thing we can do.

00:01:34.293 --> 00:01:36.274
Then everything flows everything.

00:01:36.274 --> 00:01:37.963
Everything flows beautifully.

00:01:37.963 --> 00:01:41.719
I'm not talking about vanity or arrogance

00:01:41.719 --> 00:01:44.863
because that is not
love, that's always fear.

00:01:44.863 --> 00:01:48.504
I'm talking about just really
respecting and appreciating

00:01:48.504 --> 00:01:52.925
this incredible magnificent
being that we are.

00:01:52.925 --> 00:01:56.068
Little babies know how to love themselves.

00:01:56.068 --> 00:01:58.626
You were born in pure love, all of you.

00:01:58.626 --> 00:02:02.012
There's not one little
baby alive that I know of

00:02:02.012 --> 00:02:04.779
that ever criticizes its body,

00:02:04.779 --> 00:02:07.300
that ever says my hips are too big.

00:02:07.300 --> 00:02:08.833
Have you ever heard a baby say that?

00:02:08.833 --> 00:02:11.603
(laughing)

00:02:11.603 --> 00:02:16.430
They're just thrilled and
delighted that they have a body.

00:02:16.430 --> 00:02:19.277
They rejoice in it and
they love themselves.

00:02:19.277 --> 00:02:22.381
They love their toes, they love
everything about themselves.

00:02:22.381 --> 00:02:26.885
They absolutely adore that
they express their feelings.

00:02:26.885 --> 00:02:29.232
When a baby is happy you know it.

00:02:29.232 --> 00:02:32.617
When a baby is angry, the
whole neighborhood knows it.

00:02:32.617 --> 00:02:35.628
They're never scared to let
people know how they feel.

00:02:35.628 --> 00:02:39.674
They live in the moment and
they're filled with courage

00:02:39.674 --> 00:02:43.067
and they're wonderful and
we were all like that.

00:02:43.067 --> 00:02:45.514
Got to remember that you
were filled with courage

00:02:45.514 --> 00:02:48.980
and you were full of love
and you adored yourself

00:02:48.980 --> 00:02:50.384
when you were very little.

00:02:50.384 --> 00:02:53.812
I think that everything you
think and everything you speak

00:02:53.812 --> 00:02:55.996
goes out from you into the universe

00:02:55.996 --> 00:02:59.089
and comes back to you multiplied.

00:02:59.089 --> 00:03:02.022
It's almost as though
the universe is listening

00:03:02.022 --> 00:03:04.540
to everything you say
and everything you think

00:03:04.540 --> 00:03:06.688
and saying oh that's what they want

00:03:06.688 --> 00:03:10.195
but most of the time we
are talking very negatively

00:03:10.195 --> 00:03:11.064
about ourselves.

00:03:11.064 --> 00:03:13.916
We talk about how awful, we
are we're not good enough,

00:03:13.916 --> 00:03:15.605
we can't get this, we can't get that.

00:03:15.605 --> 00:03:18.034
How can the universe
bring you anything good

00:03:18.034 --> 00:03:19.845
if that's the way you're talking?

00:03:19.845 --> 00:03:21.455
- [Interviewer] So you're
saying this quality of life

00:03:21.455 --> 00:03:24.464
doesn't mean a really nice
house or a really nice car.

00:03:24.464 --> 00:03:26.566
- It can but it doesn't have to.

00:03:26.566 --> 00:03:28.844
But what good is a nice car

00:03:28.844 --> 00:03:31.702
if you are full of resentment all the time

00:03:31.702 --> 00:03:34.644
and you drive around hating everybody?

00:03:34.644 --> 00:03:35.968
That's not going to help anything.

00:03:35.968 --> 00:03:38.150
It's much better if you had an old car

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:41.785
and you were grateful
and appreciative of life.

00:03:41.785 --> 00:03:43.934
There is a law of thinking

00:03:43.934 --> 00:03:46.033
and we are beginning to learn about it

00:03:46.033 --> 00:03:48.379
and it is like a computer.

00:03:48.379 --> 00:03:51.893
If you have this gorgeous
computer put in front of you

00:03:51.893 --> 00:03:56.362
and you don't know what to do
with it, it's a piece of junk.

00:03:56.362 --> 00:03:59.381
But if you learn the
language of the computer

00:03:59.381 --> 00:04:00.714
miracles happen.

00:04:02.602 --> 00:04:05.935
And that is what the law of thinking is.

00:04:06.895 --> 00:04:10.562
When you learn how it
works miracles happen.

00:04:13.086 --> 00:04:16.229
What you think and what you believe

00:04:16.229 --> 00:04:18.212
it's what will come true for you.

00:04:18.212 --> 00:04:20.795
Your thoughts create your life.

00:04:21.687 --> 00:04:25.149
It's that simple and when we can get that

00:04:25.149 --> 00:04:27.792
we can make enormous changes.

00:04:27.792 --> 00:04:31.724
One of the things that I
think about the work that I do

00:04:31.724 --> 00:04:33.165
and the work our company does

00:04:33.165 --> 00:04:35.724
is that every product that we sell

00:04:35.724 --> 00:04:39.723
or the product that you
get as a gift from us,

00:04:39.723 --> 00:04:43.767
has the possibility to change
the quality of your life,

00:04:43.767 --> 00:04:45.494
to improve the quality of your life.

00:04:45.494 --> 00:04:47.972
Whether you actually take
that opportunity or not

00:04:47.972 --> 00:04:49.664
is up to you, that's freedom

00:04:49.664 --> 00:04:53.212
but everything we give out can help people

00:04:53.212 --> 00:04:56.071
really improve the quality of their lives.

00:04:56.071 --> 00:04:57.770
And that feels good.

00:04:57.770 --> 00:05:00.450
When we have a problem most of us go,

00:05:00.450 --> 00:05:03.964
oh panic panic, God
what are we going to do?

00:05:03.964 --> 00:05:07.717
But I have something that
I try to get people to say.

00:05:07.717 --> 00:05:10.069
In the minute there's a
problem you stop and you go,

00:05:10.069 --> 00:05:11.394
all is well.

00:05:11.394 --> 00:05:16.302
All is well, everything's
working out for my highest good

00:05:16.302 --> 00:05:20.266
and out of this experience
only good will come

00:05:20.266 --> 00:05:21.433
and I am safe.

00:05:22.366 --> 00:05:24.884
And you do this if it's a small thing,

00:05:24.884 --> 00:05:26.127
I say it two or three times.

00:05:26.127 --> 00:05:29.271
If it's a bigger issue
I babble it incessantly

00:05:29.271 --> 00:05:30.715
but all is well,

00:05:30.715 --> 00:05:33.647
everything is working
out for my highest good.

00:05:33.647 --> 00:05:37.814
Out of this situation only
good will come and I am safe.

00:05:39.113 --> 00:05:43.030
This quiets your inner
turmoil down long enough

00:05:44.686 --> 00:05:47.085
for the universe to find the solution

00:05:47.085 --> 00:05:48.990
to the so-called problem.

00:05:48.990 --> 00:05:50.064
When there's problems,

00:05:50.064 --> 00:05:52.040
we don't have to fix problems so much

00:05:52.040 --> 00:05:54.642
we need to fix our thinking

00:05:54.642 --> 00:05:58.650
and our attitude about
how we respond to them.

00:05:58.650 --> 00:06:00.108
And then you get less and less

00:06:00.108 --> 00:06:03.083
and when the solution
comes you say thank you.

00:06:03.083 --> 00:06:07.374
You start by doing what
we call doing affirmations

00:06:07.374 --> 00:06:11.393
and that is making positive
statements about your life

00:06:11.393 --> 00:06:15.688
that are positive and
you do them deliberately.

00:06:15.688 --> 00:06:16.889
You might do them in the morning,

00:06:16.889 --> 00:06:17.837
you might do them at noon,

00:06:17.837 --> 00:06:19.450
you might do them at night,

00:06:19.450 --> 00:06:23.226
you might do them you know
twice a day or whatever.

00:06:23.226 --> 00:06:26.313
But you do this and you
let this become a habit

00:06:26.313 --> 00:06:30.396
and as you start to do them,
things will begin to change.

00:06:30.396 --> 00:06:32.662
Maybe on a very small level.

00:06:32.662 --> 00:06:35.887
I call it getting the green
lights from the parking places.

00:06:35.887 --> 00:06:38.076
I mean they're not huge
things in your life,

00:06:38.076 --> 00:06:39.107
but it can be very nice

00:06:39.107 --> 00:06:41.344
when you get three green lights in a row

00:06:41.344 --> 00:06:43.177
and you're in a hurry.

00:06:44.080 --> 00:06:46.595
Doing an affirmation is
either writing it down,

00:06:46.595 --> 00:06:50.397
writing it on the wall or the mirror

00:06:50.397 --> 00:06:51.966
or just saying it.

00:06:51.966 --> 00:06:56.471
What I like people to do is
to stand in front of a mirror

00:06:56.471 --> 00:06:58.295
and do their affirmations

00:06:58.295 --> 00:07:00.407
because there's something very powerful

00:07:00.407 --> 00:07:04.574
about looking in your own
eyes and accepting yourself

00:07:06.681 --> 00:07:09.284
or noticing that you reject yourself

00:07:09.284 --> 00:07:12.425
when you're saying something
positive about yourself.

00:07:12.425 --> 00:07:16.115
So that would be a very
beginning way to start.

00:07:16.115 --> 00:07:17.242
Say in the morning.

00:07:17.242 --> 00:07:19.146
You get up in the morning,
you go to the mirror

00:07:19.146 --> 00:07:23.699
and this is a big one and
it's hard for lots of people

00:07:23.699 --> 00:07:26.597
but you look in the mirror and say,

00:07:26.597 --> 00:07:29.680
I love you, I really really love you.

00:07:31.149 --> 00:07:33.626
And to begin with that
can be so hard for people

00:07:33.626 --> 00:07:34.865
because they think of all the things

00:07:34.865 --> 00:07:36.557
that they think are wrong with them

00:07:36.557 --> 00:07:39.162
but if you can start your day saying that

00:07:39.162 --> 00:07:40.976
it's very powerful.

00:07:40.976 --> 00:07:43.541
- We do have a tendency in the society

00:07:43.541 --> 00:07:45.572
to just want to be fixed.

00:07:45.572 --> 00:07:46.477
- Yes, and then that's it.

00:07:46.477 --> 00:07:47.348
- And that's it.

00:07:47.348 --> 00:07:50.064
When I get over this
problem, this will be it.

00:07:50.064 --> 00:07:51.835
I'll never have to deal
with anything again.

00:07:51.835 --> 00:07:55.545
- A lot of us just want to
stop when we hit a safe place.

00:07:55.545 --> 00:07:56.782
I mean you've got a bit of money,

00:07:56.782 --> 00:07:57.853
you've got some nice friends,

00:07:57.853 --> 00:08:01.428
you have a good house to
live in and you're okay.

00:08:01.428 --> 00:08:02.546
You think, all right that's fine.

00:08:02.546 --> 00:08:04.572
I'm not going to touch anything else.

00:08:04.572 --> 00:08:09.030
But I have watched me
and how life works for me

00:08:09.030 --> 00:08:12.198
is that when I get to a really
good level then it's like,

00:08:12.198 --> 00:08:15.625
okay now we're going to
deal with this thing.

00:08:15.625 --> 00:08:16.740
And there's another thing.

00:08:16.740 --> 00:08:20.580
And I've learned to just
say, okay what do I do.

00:08:20.580 --> 00:08:24.264
Leave me alone, don't
talk to me about that.

00:08:24.264 --> 00:08:27.237
I say thank you many many
many times of the day.

00:08:27.237 --> 00:08:30.089
Often not to anyone
else, just oh thank you.

00:08:30.089 --> 00:08:32.672
That's so wonderful, thank you.

00:08:33.980 --> 00:08:37.175
You find more and more
things to be thankful about.

00:08:37.175 --> 00:08:40.066
I was driving up today from San Diego

00:08:40.066 --> 00:08:43.629
and the wildflowers on the hillsides

00:08:43.629 --> 00:08:46.112
are just beautiful this year

00:08:46.112 --> 00:08:48.214
and I was thinking I was so glad

00:08:48.214 --> 00:08:51.518
that I had the opportunity to see them

00:08:51.518 --> 00:08:53.572
because if I stayed down
there I wouldn't have.

00:08:53.572 --> 00:08:54.405
But with this drive,

00:08:54.405 --> 00:08:57.816
which was not a drive I
particularly wanted to make,

00:08:57.816 --> 00:08:59.265
but it was gorgeous.

00:08:59.265 --> 00:09:03.437
If you have very strong beliefs within you

00:09:03.437 --> 00:09:06.819
that you don't deserve
good things in your life,

00:09:06.819 --> 00:09:08.472
and a lot of people have that,

00:09:08.472 --> 00:09:11.029
then there can be delays

00:09:11.029 --> 00:09:12.220
and sometimes people say,

00:09:12.220 --> 00:09:14.576
well affirmations don't
work, I've done them,

00:09:14.576 --> 00:09:18.709
but when they're doing for
instance prosperity affirmations

00:09:18.709 --> 00:09:20.777
and they've done some
prosperity affirmations

00:09:20.777 --> 00:09:22.552
and they say, it doesn't
work, nothing's happening

00:09:22.552 --> 00:09:23.667
and I say, well alright,

00:09:23.667 --> 00:09:27.049
how many prosperity
affirmations did you do in a day

00:09:27.049 --> 00:09:29.112
and they'll say three probably

00:09:29.112 --> 00:09:29.945
and I say, all right,

00:09:29.945 --> 00:09:33.707
how many poverty affirmations
did you do this day

00:09:33.707 --> 00:09:35.439
and that could be 300

00:09:35.439 --> 00:09:37.546
depending on where you're coming from

00:09:37.546 --> 00:09:40.713
and what is running through your mind.

00:09:42.208 --> 00:09:43.867
One of my thoughts about life

00:09:43.867 --> 00:09:46.793
is that only good lies before me

00:09:46.793 --> 00:09:50.129
and I've been saying this for many years.

00:09:50.129 --> 00:09:54.296
So it doesn't really matter
to me what happens in life

00:09:55.169 --> 00:09:57.071
because I know it's going to be good.

00:09:57.071 --> 00:09:58.270
- Thank you guys so much for watching.

00:09:58.270 --> 00:10:01.573
I made this video because
Kyle augurs asked me to.

00:10:01.573 --> 00:10:02.787
So if there's a famous entrepreneur

00:10:02.787 --> 00:10:04.564
that you want me to profile next,

00:10:04.564 --> 00:10:05.807
leave it in the comments below.

00:10:05.807 --> 00:10:06.888
I will see what we can do.

00:10:06.888 --> 00:10:10.066
I'd also love to know which
of Louise's top 10 rules

00:10:10.066 --> 00:10:11.421
had the biggest impact on you

00:10:11.421 --> 00:10:13.783
and what change you're
going to make as a result.

00:10:13.783 --> 00:10:16.303
Leave it in the comments below
and I'll join the discussion.

00:10:16.303 --> 00:10:17.871
Thank you so much for watching.

00:10:17.871 --> 00:10:21.371
Continue to believe and I'll see you soon.

